    },
    {
      "target": "A6 - Assign Action-Item Owners and Due Dates",
      "rationale": "Action items identified in the meeting summary could be automatically extracted and pre-populated into the action-item tracker, with the manager only needing to confirm or adjust owner assignments and due dates.",
